# Villainous Syndication: "Tap an untapped Villain you control: Mill a card. Put a plan counter on this enchantment.
# Activate only as a sorcery. When the fourth plan counter is put on this enchantment, sacrifice it. When you do, return
# target creature card from your graveyard to the battlefield." On turn 1 Bot1 taps its Serpent Specialist and its Aerial
# Doombot, both cast this turn (tapping them for another permanent's cost is no {T} ability of theirs, CR 302.6): it mills
# the Llanowar Elves and an Island and has two plan counters. In its turn-3 upkeep the ability is not offered (sorcery speed),
# and its Ornithopter is no Villain to tap. In the main phase it taps both Villains again: the fourth plan counter
# sacrifices it, and the reflexive ability returns the Elves from the graveyard to the battlefield.

